talog.jsonSchema({ strict: true }) is the structured-output shape — but elements is a map, so strict JSON Schema cannot list keys; that is why a\\n  generate loop that only dumps jsonSchema({ strict: true }) cannot autogenerate the whole GUI by itself.\\n\\n  2. Blob / plugin catalog (what exists on the bus)\\n\\n  Each plugin’s Rust state struct is its PluginSchema (schemars → seal). Live artifacts:\\n\\n  ┌───────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n  │ Store         │ Path                                            │ Meaning                                           │\\n  ├───────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\\n  │ Sealed schema │ /dev/shm/opdbus/plugin-blobs/<id>.<hash16>.blob │ Immutable contract + schema_hash                  │\\n  ├───────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\\n  │ Manifest      │ plugin-blobs/.manifest.json                     │ catalog_hash, generation                          │\\n  ├───────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\\n  │ Present state │ /dev/shm/opdbus/state/<id>.json                 │ Live values                                       │\\n  ├───────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\\n  │ HTTP          │ GET /api/ui-model/plugin-schema/:plugin         │ Full schema + schema_hash + ui_projection + state │\\n  └───────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────────────┴───────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\\n\\n  Render source is schema_json in the blob, never gRPC reflection (reflection is methods-only and collapses types).\\n\\n  ui_surfaces on a plugin (e.g. antigravity) are { path, name, schema }\n<truncated 82921 of 92813 byte